      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Neuroblockade techniques can serve many functions in the management of the chronic pain patient. These various functions are discussed and a brief insight given for their use in specific pain syndromes. A run-down of the type of blocks useful in the management of cancer pain is also given."},
